ase randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nIn a cinema, friends are choosing movies, there are 40 screenings. Xiao Gang tells Xiao Mei, \"I think most of the screenings choose to watch comedy movies, some action movies, very few romance movies.\" Xiao Mei counts and finds that there are only 5 action movies.\n\n[Question]\nPlease ask how many comedy movies Xiao Mei guesses before counting?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Before counting, Xiao Mei guesses 39 comedy movies.\nB. Before counting, Xiao Mei guesses 40 comedy movies.\nC. Before counting, Xiao Mei guesses 20 comedy movies.\nD. Before counting, Xiao Mei guesses 35 comedy movies.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.001032202596790636,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e19cd6006945d27ffecd","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367900778,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:31:40","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"e6f9e62c3c924a83828d7dcce90362f7"}